+|---|---|---|
+| G1 planted verifies | pending final report | 12 preset/seed checks in the last local run |
+| G2 corruptions | pending final report | drop/swap/duplicate/empty/range have distinct failures |
+| G3 round trip | pending final report | tagged JSON with surrounding prose |
